Package: readPBOC
Title: Read People's Bank of China Data and Statistical Releases
Version: 0.1.3
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Chartwell", family = "Macro",
           email = "chartwellmacro@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Provides tools to discover, download, read, and normalise
    statistical data published by the People's Bank of China (PBOC). It
    supports the Chinese and English websites, XLS/XLSX spreadsheets, HTML
    tables, statistical release pages and attachments, and revision-aware
    catalogs, manifests, snapshots, and comparisons. PDF attachments can be
    preserved for offline use but are not parsed. Public resources are accessed
    from the official PBOC website (<https://www.pbc.gov.cn/>) on request;
    local reading and comparison workflows can run offline.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
